---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Competitions | Irvington FBLA" description="Explore the wide range of competitive events offered by FBLA, from objective tests to role-plays and presentations.">
	<section class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>FBLA Competitions</h1>
			<p>Showcase your skills and compete at the highest level</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="text-content">
				<h2>What are FBLA Competitions?</h2>
				<p>FBLA offers over 70 competitive events that cover a wide range of business, technology, and leadership topics. Competitions allow members to demonstrate their knowledge and skills, with top performers advancing from Regional to State and National Leadership Conferences.</p>
				
				<h2>Types of Events</h2>
				
				<h3>Objective Tests</h3>
				<p>These are 60-minute online exams that test your knowledge on specific subjects. Examples include:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Accounting I & II</li>
					<li>Business Law</li>
					<li>Economics</li>
					<li>Introduction to Business Procedures</li>
					<li>Marketing</li>
				</ul>

				<h3>Production Events</h3>
				<p>These events involve a production test (creating documents, spreadsheets, etc.) followed by an objective test. Examples include:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Computer Applications</li>
					<li>Spreadsheet Applications</li>
					<li>Word Processing</li>
				</ul>

				<h3>Performance Events (Role Plays & Presentations)</h3>
				<p>These events require you to present to judges, either with a prepared presentation or a case study role play. Examples include:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Business Ethics</li>
					<li>Client Service</li>
					<li>Emerging Business Issues</li>
					<li>Impromptu Speaking</li>
					<li>Public Speaking</li>
					<li>Sales Presentation</li>
				</ul>
				
				<h2>Competition Levels</h2>
				<ol>
					<li><strong>Bay Section Leadership Conference (BSLC):</strong> The regional competition where Irvington FBLA members compete against other schools in the Bay Area.</li>
					<li><strong>State Leadership Conference (SLC):</strong> Top performers from BSLC advance to compete against students from all over California.</li>
					<li><strong>National Leadership Conference (NLC):</strong> The best of the best from each state compete on the national stage.</li>
				</ol>

				<h2>How to Prepare</h2>
				<p>Irvington FBLA provides numerous resources to help you succeed, including study guides, practice tests, and workshop sessions. Check out our <a href="/competitive-resources">Resources page</a> for more information.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0052cc 0%, #003366 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: white;
		opacity: 1;
	}

	.content-section {
		padding: 4rem 0;
	}

	.text-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	h2 {
		color: #003366;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 2rem;
	}
	
	h3 {
		color: #0052cc;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}

	ul, ol {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}
	
	strong {
		color: #1f2937;
	}
	
	a {
		color: #0052cc;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>